{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04031.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04031.SBN", "offset": 293, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f0d8fa8af0d8f27ef184f7d12f2ff0acf0b8f957f18ef263f0a32f2ff6a5f0aff291f0f0f0ef815c8144", "baseline_text": "그건 그렇고…//레니는 정말로//밝아졌네요―．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "それにしても……//レニって、ホントに//明るくなりましたねー。", "pointer_offset": 252, "unit": "dialogue:5a4f8e0e406db507", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04031.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04031.SBN", "offset": 354, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0d8f26ff261f7d12f2ff0a5f0a4f1d48143f0d8fa62f0b5f0aef0b6f0b7f0f481432f2ff26af1f9f8b6f34af0ccf15a8144", "baseline_text": "그럴까…//하지만，그런 오리히메도，//상당히 변했어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そうかな……//でも、そういう織姫も、//ずいぶん変わった。", "pointer_offset": 256, "unit": "dialogue:0fca58e52fe3cbeb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04031.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04031.SBN", "offset": 411, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f25c81432f2ff192f94ef0bcf4bef0c3f1572f2ff1f7f9eaf0cff272f0b8f261f0ef81608144", "baseline_text": "뭐，//성조 시절과는//전혀 다르니까요～．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "まあ、//星組のころとは、//ぜんぜんちがいますからね～。", "pointer_offset": 260, "unit": "dialogue:c1cae60b76341df2", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04031.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04031.SBN", "offset": 466, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f271f0f9f8e7f0a4f167f984f2bff0cff957f0adf2c3f7d12f2ff8d8f0bcf4bef0b9f957f1b5f1f3f15a8144", "baseline_text": "모두를 지키고 싶다는 마음…//그 시절에는 없었어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "みんなを守りたい気持ち……//あのころにはなかった。", "pointer_offset": 264, "unit": "dialogue:cff5b91db8f7fe00", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04031.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04031.SBN", "offset": 517, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0dff162f25ff0e4f0b2f7d1f271f0f9f14481432f2ff1adf0aef8e7f1abfdf6fa4ef299f1ccf0a4f0f42f2ff271f272f29ef0f0f7d1", "baseline_text": "제국극장이…모두가，//우리를 바꿔 준 것일지도//모르겠네…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "帝劇が……みんなが、//ボクたちを変えてくれたのかも//しれないね……", "pointer_offset": 268, "unit": "dialogue:f04355d2dff2cb52", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04031.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04031.SBN", "offset": 584, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f1adf2cef2cef7d12f2ff0acf0b8f957f0dff162f25ff0e4f0b22f2ffaccf0adf2c3f8b9f186f8b1f1acf0f0f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "우후후…//레니는 제국극장이//꽤 마음에 드나 보네요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うふふ……//レニは帝劇のことが//かなり気に入ってますね！", "pointer_offset": 272, "unit": "dialogue:9ccf6a958c94ce9a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04031.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04031.SBN", "offset": 641, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f7d1f0b5f0aef0b6f0b7f0f481432f2ff0d8f27ef276f0af8148", "baseline_text": "…오리히메도，//그렇잖아？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……織姫だって、//そうだろう？", "pointer_offset": 276, "unit": "dialogue:c9fce09aea7adae7", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04031.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04031.SBN", "offset": 811, "capacity": 76, "raw_hex": "f1f9f181f0a5f252816081b82f2ff0b2f3e3f8c8f0a4f167f94ff279f14bf147f0a8f1c781432f2ff0b1f144f148f0aaf0a8f8f4f2e4f0c7f557f0aef1842f2ff263f29ef15af0ef816081b8", "baseline_text": "당연하죠～∈//이곳을 지키기 위해서라면，//나가야스라도 쓰러뜨리고//말겠어요～∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "もちのろんでーす！//この場所を守るためなら、//長安だろうと倒してみせま～す∈", "pointer_offset": 280, "unit": "dialogue:4e42c8da445a67ed", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04031.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04031.SBN", "offset": 749, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f0b1f0f481432f2ff0a4fc83fc95f1c8f148f7d12f2ff16bf2c5f0c3f8f4f1abfaf4f94af1b5f957f0b2f3e3f0c881b8", "baseline_text": "나도，//지켜 낼 거야…//무엇과도 바꿀 수 없는 이곳을∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ボクも、//守ってみせるよ……//このかけがえのない場所を！", "pointer_offset": 284, "unit": "dialogue:cbc92d05fde2a127", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04031.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04031.SBN", "offset": 806, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "6d61696e", "baseline_text": "main", "kind": "ascr", "source": "main", "pointer_offset": 288, "unit": "dialogue:0d6e4079e36703eb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
